    "body": "fix on issue/780-field-march-up · PR #817 (draft, stacked on #784 on #782) · pinned by field_floor::{a_flipped_bake_reads_a_cut_floor_exactly_from_cut_downs, a_flipped_slot_through_the_plate_reads_empty_and_its_neighbours_exact, a_flipped_sliver_under_the_top_is_read_from_the_record_above_it, a_flipped_bounded_tool_refuses_by_name, an_unaligned_plane_reads_its_shell_crossing_on_both_sides}, carry_engine_agreement::{a_baked_turn_reads_what_the_view_reads_through_every_turn (all 8 turns, flips included), an_unaligned_block_top_carries_the_same_on_both_engines, a_slot_cut_after_the_flip_carries_the_same_on_both_engines, a_sliver_between_a_cut_from_below_and_one_from_above_carries_the_same, a_second_slot_through_the_first_carries_the_same_on_both_engines}, solid_rest::tests::a_level_facet_crosses_at_exactly_its_height · merges when reviewed.\n\nLanded in one PR: march_up + the two-sided column_span, the sliver scan (E1's floor sliver, its mirror, and a sliver between two cuts), the shell-crossing read in both marches, E2a's interim CutFromBelow lifted (pinned first, then replaced), and a root fix in solid_rest::plane_claim that the heavy stock_engine_agreement lane caught (a level facet's crossing rounded by an ulp; it answers its own z now). Nothing split off; E2c (#781) is next on the stack. Quick gate and app's heavy engine-agreement lane (release) green; the Linux batch gate's result follows on the PR.",
